{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>本年度《2026香港小姐競選》今日（2日）在電視城舉行首輪面試，有份獲邀參加首輪面試的參選佳麗於早上到達電視城，準備下午見無綫高層進行面試。當中不乏打扮性感、身材出眾的高質靚女，而23歲的吳芍希因五官標緻樣子甜美而成為大熱。</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、林迅景、陳釗</p><figure><img alt=\"吳芍希 23歲 香港人 在紐約讀書 剛剛畢業 現從事金融工作。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413620154339328631982.jpeg/h9x9TXBq6PQaBjKb4iKN6ZUHlRxGH2u_cr_ymXK_8pk\"/><figcaption>吳芍希 23歲 香港人 在紐約讀書 剛剛畢業 現從事金融工作。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳芍希貌似薛凱琪。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413617805398016810356.jpeg/RDj6QAP3QQolj5EaNVF5sZcKT1M0z5_IzQERe80BEXs\"/><figcaption>吳芍希貌似薛凱琪。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138422904464084992730428.jpeg/cd9cZDJW-Diwv0mXPl_bITxi97IFyM2izd3lAc3d5QE\"/><figure><img alt=\"Vita，身高172cm。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138422906859163648628401.jpeg/tkxh9Jno-OJP2pH-FMFk-RwmvwSqe0VeucGodbnBqHU\"/><figcaption>Vita，身高172cm。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138424804844507136860931.jpeg/0R-x78-OT7Lsh3SQq-raIA5Tq_jozPwSfn5HXX5-R10\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138424430033113088156432.jpeg/5L8moeCbvRSQcavt0dmmE1qXAl9FxxLyHUc1kR1HNZE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138430003596234752850634.jpeg/s9oNlCGD1tpKqmEa9icObTtqajAX9spc0fnzStH580o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138419238646583296204369.jpeg/9ms02uPwL9SQSXsBBKvfyZ9CMiJf7gmlOrhaUzq4WlM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138423682910130176964073.jpeg/ouY9WaEFM9Vx7zhBdfRTlCNFjkuCeH6ySO_bskjv27I\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138429190421352448148627.jpeg/Grnsa-lDcdnbQh0ONCJ1-S-ntUupwhElFZWY9RWVmPU\"/><figure><img alt=\"黃薇。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413608099647488523647.jpeg/46T0hP9JQbNK8G0p9J69rDVFx7w7pl-Lau3Snmrt0p4\"/><figcaption>黃薇。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T02:58:25.743194+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}